{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_61_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_61","textTraditional":"一、三十有二年，春，城小穀。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_61_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_61","textTraditional":"二、夏，宋公、齊侯遇於梁丘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_61_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_61","textTraditional":"遇者，志相得也。梁丘在曹、邾之間，去齊八百里，非不能從諸侯而往也。辭所遇，遇所不遇，大桓公也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_61_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_61","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月，癸巳，公子牙卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_61_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_61","textTraditional":"四、八月，癸亥，公薨於路寢。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_61_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_61","textTraditional":"路寢，正寢也。寢疾居正寢，正也。男子不絕於婦人之手，以齋終也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_61_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_61","textTraditional":"五、冬，十月，乙未，子般卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_61_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_61","textTraditional":"子卒日，正也。不日，故也。有所見則日。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_61_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_61","textTraditional":"六、公子慶父如齊。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_61_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_61","textTraditional":"此奔也，其曰如何也？諱莫如深，深則隱。苟有所見，莫如深也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_61_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_61","textTraditional":"七、狄伐邢。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}